treamEvent event\nend: LmP0PendingDelimiter\n\nstruct: LmP0PendingMix\n    @: LmP0StreamEvent events\n    size_t: count\n    size_t: capacity\nend: LmP0PendingMix\n\nstruct: LmP0IndentStack\n    @: size_t columns\n    size_t: count\n    size_t: capacity\nend: LmP0IndentStack\n\nstruct: LmP0DisabledState\n    int: body_started\n", f) < 0
